      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart E \u2014 Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Fuel system lightning protection.",
      "text": "[The fuel system must be designed and arranged to prevent the ignition of fuel vapor within the system by--\n(a) Direct lightning strikes to areas having a high probability of stroke attachment;\n(b) Swept lightning strokes to areas where swept strokes are highly probable; or\n(c) Corona and streamering at fuel vent outlets.]",
